cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below,
  and cite the three papers listed under "references" (paper 3,
  doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.33158615, is the one this package implements).
type: software
title: pit-release-gate
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-08-15'
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/MaxWellApexLab/pit-release-gate'
authors:
  - name: 'Max Well Apex LLC'
    email: maxwellapexlab@proton.me
abstract: >-
  Completeness-aware release control for staggered-arrival
  cross-sectional data: a susceptibility-graded gate that prevents
  incomplete-cross-section leakage without a blanket timeliness penalty.
keywords:
  - point-in-time
  - data-leakage
  - look-ahead-bias
  - cross-sectional
  - release-control
  - selection-bias
references:
